---
title: "initialize (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_params: validate initialization parameters
    q_validate_params --> q_check_timing: params valid
    q_validate_params --> q_revert_invalid: params invalid
    q_check_timing --> q_check_ecies: startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: timing constraints violated
    q_check_ecies --> q_check_addresses: publicKey is valid EC point (x, y on curve)
    q_check_ecies --> q_revert_ecies: invalid ECIES public key
    q_check_addresses --> q_set_config: bidToken != address(0) AND askToken != address(0) AND projectAdmin != address(0)
    q_check_addresses --> q_revert_addr: invalid addresses
    q_set_config --> q_set_ecies: startTime, endTime, refundEndTime, minimumInvestAmount configured
    q_set_ecies --> q_set_addresses: publicKey = _publicKey (ECIES encryption key)
    q_set_addresses --> [*]: bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry configured, emit Initialized()
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert InvalidTiming
    q_revert_ecies --> [*]: revert InvalidPublicKey
    q_revert_addr --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress

    note right of q_check_ecies
        INV-001: ECIES public key must be a valid elliptic curve point
        INV-002: Private key not stored at initialization (revealed post-auction)
    end note
